    "detailed_description": "<i>Thrown into a century long war between the Union and the Kingdoms, a lone starship Captain decides to rebel against his fate. Join him in his galactic journey and discover the various stories that can still bloom in the Ashes of War.</i><br><br>&quot;Ashes of War&quot; offers you the classic VN experience with cute and fun characters, beautiful CGs, rich storytelling, and romance options between the colorful cast, this time with a Sci-Fi militaristic background. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265610/extras/04d8c768603a0769c324e3eddf03dd9e.avif?t=1734798231\" /></span><br><br>Faced with numerous challenges, some less mundane than others, make sure your ship and allies do not meet a grim fate while you build relationships with the four heroines and delve into the story of individuals trying to enjoy their newly found freedom. <br><br>Follow the adventures of the Dawn of Defiance's Captain turned deserter as he learns to flirt his way through the galaxy in this brand new Sci-Fi Visual Novel!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>- Visual novel with dynamic 3D CGs for action scenes.<br>- 2D and 3D artwork made with passion.<br>- Mostly kinetic.(for now)",
